==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|говно́|-ед|t1=shit|t2=eater}}. Compare {{cog|uk|гівної́д|t=shiteater}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|говное́д}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|b|говное́д|a=an}}

# {{lb|ru|vulgar|offensive|literal}} a [[shiteater]], a [[scatophage]]
#: {{uxi|ru|Я не бу́ду с э́тим '''говное́дом''' сиде́ть, су́ка, блядь, а?!|I will not sit with this '''shit-eater''', what the fuck?!}}
# {{lb|ru|vulgar|offensive|slang}} [[bastard]], an unpleasant person
# {{lb|ru|vulgar|offensive|slang}} an [[omnivorous]] person who does not care about the quality of their food
# {{lb|ru|vulgar|offensive|slang}} a person with poor artistic taste who does not care about the quality of their favourite/favorite media
# {{lb|ru|vulgar|offensive|slang}} a dog that rolls and smears its body with feces

